repro_steps: Run pm duplicates --since 2026-08-20 --output-format json on 2026.8.21; observe universal-output refusal despite successful structured TOON output without the flag.
resolution: "Resolved: duplicates participates in the typed universal read-output contract across CLI and SDK while preserving bounded TOON defaults."
